#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on PROVENANCE (charter Hard Rule 10,
# ex:saNoRemintProvenanceTerms): a fixture that RE-MINTS gmeow:wasGeneratedBy as rdfs:isDefinedBy
# the preference slice — the AC7 no-duplication violation (Principle 16). The slice REUSES the
# provenance spine (e.g. gmeow:cellObservation ⊑ gmeow:wasDerivedFrom) at the instance level,
# never re-minting it. Unioned with the module by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes
# the ∃-redeclared-term ASK HOLD, proving the mustNot ban has teeth. The module must never carry
# this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:wasGeneratedBy rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
